    {
      "id": 142225,
      "name": "jffdougan",
      "username": "jffdougan",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-27T21:26:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"seesome\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/48/2018_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> seesome:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have to admit that I don't have the patience to watch the streams; watching videos of other people playing games, even games I love and obsess over, has never interested me. &nbsp;Is there a tread in the forum where people post interesting news tidbits from the streams?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I don't generally get to watch them live, but tend to catch up on YouTube at later dates. Then, if people start babbling, I can FF a bit.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:19:27.035Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
