      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"seesome\"]\n\nI have to admit that I don&#39;t have the patience to watch the streams; watching videos of other people playing games, even games I love and obsess over, has never interested me. &nbsp;Is there a tread in the forum where people post interesting news tidbits from the streams?\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI don&#39;t generally get to watch them live, but tend to catch up on YouTube at later dates. Then, if people start babbling, I can FF a bit.\n",
